================================================================================
Modifications and additions in this distribution
================================================================================

This repository is a derivative work that modifies and extends QuEmb to support
variational-quantum-eigensolver (VQE) fragment solvers for quantum bootstrap
embedding. The following components were added or substantially modified for the
work described in the accompanying paper and are Copyright 2026 Derek Peng,
released under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  - quemb/src/quemb/molbe/vqe_solver.py          VQE / ADAPT-VQE fragment solver
  - quemb/src/quemb/molbe/fast_adapt_vqe.py      FastAdaptVQE (sparse statevector gradients)
  - quemb/src/quemb/molbe/matrix_free_adapt_vqe.py  MatrixFreeAdaptVQE (matrix-free gradients)
  - scripts/lookahead_utils.py                   Lookahead operator-selection utilities
  - scripts/ and figure_creation_scripts/        reproduction and figure scripts

